<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 93,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 93,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA Friday's actual receipts 93,000 and Saturday's 10,000 head at interior Iowa and southern Minnesota. Opening trade was not well established. Early sales barrows and gilts were steady to $0.50 lower compared with mid-session Friday. Top $57.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>			   Country		   Plants</p>
