<p>few				 54.50		    55.50</p>
<p>Sows - up $1.00/off $1.00. Top $52.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  43.00 -45.00	   44.00 -46.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   44.00 -47.50	   44.00 -48.00</p>
